Z||000001||Urchin||09-02-2001||02:45 AM||||That reminds me of when I had first taken an interest in fieros.  I had been told on more than one occasion that pontiac had produced a number of V8 fieros in '88 which led to them being discontinued.  According to sources the fiero was resposible for a reduction in corvette sales.  Fieros offered equal power at more affordable prices and were selling like mad.  I am still trying to determine whether they were pulling my leg, or somehow misinformed.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/side_cut_sig_4.jpg">  <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
