Z||000007||Oreif||09-02-2001||09:21 AM||||I can't believe this is a "One and only" prototype. VIN #'s always start at 001. the VIN on this shows it's # 66. Why would the prototype VIN be #066? It is a GM VIN.<P>1G1AY0789E5120066<P>Who ever has a carfax account could run the VIN and see if it is really registered.<p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 09-02-2001).]||||reg||1
